	(text "RS485 (DIRECTION FROM TX)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 377.6639 182.755 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "045759d7-2411-5ed4-bb27-a39c020d12b4")
	)
	(text "TCA9534 pins start as inputs; the 100k pull-downs then hold every valve off until\nfirmware drives them. Address 0x20 (A0-A2 low). P0-P7 high = valve 1-8 on.\nValves 5-8 may be left unfitted (FET, pull-down, diode, LED, resistor, terminal) (D75).\nValves: 12 V DC, low-side switched, up to ~2 A each (D73); total from 12 V IN ~3 A,\nset by F1 (D77). Not for latching valves or 24 V AC valves.\nFLYBACK (D69): each diode returns to the same +12V as its valve's V+ pin, after D2.\nA valve wired to any other supply loses its clamp."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 74.93 516.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "08fadcd2-0b31-5736-aee9-bb4a0511e140")
	)
	(text "LI-ION CHARGER & CELL PROTECTION"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 481.8331 35.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3ca8a4ea-9704-5900-8014-ae188a753127")
	)
	(text "USB-C INPUT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 35.6973 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3e88e169-407d-5169-9872-49c7cf148343")
	)
	(text "SYSTEM POWER: LOAD SHARING, 3.3 V LDO, SWITCHED RAILS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 641.098 35.435 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "43ae2514-a909-5a5c-ab4b-627db3e11019")
	)
	(text "CC1/CC2: 5.1k each to GND (USB-C sink, 5 V only).\nFit R3/R4 for an ESP32-C6 module, R5/R6 (DNP) for a C3 module:\nthe two modules have USB on different pads (DECISIONS D15/D19)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 123.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "449db40d-6870-5a5d-ba48-1b9e533870af")
	)
	(text "Pull-ups are on +3V3_SW, so nothing back-powers sensors when the rail is off.\nFirmware must switch +3V3_SW on before ANY I2C traffic, including valve changes:\nthe TCA9534 (on always-on 3V3) holds its outputs meanwhile (D20). OLED shares the bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 280.67 298.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4a982add-a00c-5b32-969b-996c48d69278")
	)
	(text "F1 (3 A hold, 16 V) trips on a shorted cable (D77); D2 (SS54, 5 A) blocks reverse\npolarity; D3 (SMAJ15A) clamps surges. 15 V max input.\nV12_SENSE = 12 V x 100k/660k: 2.27 V at 15 V, inside the ADC range (D23).\nAP63205: fixed 5 V out. L1/C6/C7 to be checked against the datasheet (D25)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 97.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4e5fe433-591c-539b-8a88-8800096e8465")
	)
	(text "Pads marked [C6]/[C3] differ between the two modules (D15, D18).\nEverything essential uses pads that work on both; BTN2 and GPIO_A/B work\nonly with a C6. SW2 is BOOT and BTN1 (IO9 strap). IO8/IO9 must be high at reset.\nC17/C18 close to module pin 3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 58.42 323.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5ed32039-2b13-518a-8c4a-54f884dba550")
	)
	(text "DI is tied low: the driver only ever sends 0, gated by TX through Q9.\nA 1 (and idle) is held by the 680R bias pair. Fine for Modbus at 9600 baud;\nmarginal with termination at both cable ends (D21). Bridge JP3 at a bus end.\nTransceiver, bias and pull-ups are on +3V3_SW, so RS485 is off with the rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 406.4 293.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "659fe944-1840-5be2-871b-26127fd95a42")
	)
	(text "PROG: I = 1200 / R. 4.7k = 255 mA; bridge JP1 (2.35k) = 510 mA (D12).\nTEMP: JP2 bridged disables the NTC input. For a cell NTC, cut JP2 and fit\nR11 + J3 with values from the TP4056 datasheet (D27).\nJ4 (JST-PH): pin 1 = cell -, pin 2 = cell +. JST-PH polarity is not standardised:\ncheck each cell before connecting (D28).\nProtection (DW01A + FS8205A) sits in the cell's negative lead: board GND is the pack's P-."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 491.49 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "914c8221-f3df-5f26-89a3-22728391b690")
	)
	(text "ESP32-C6 / C3 MODULE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 41.6583 182.755 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9de8e411-8a39-54a3-b552-5b3e49402250")
	)
	(text "D7 + Q2: with 5 V present VSYS comes through D7 and Q2 is off;\nwithout it Q2 turns on and the cell feeds VSYS. The charger never carries the load.\nVBAT_SENSE = VBAT / 2 (1M/1M, ~2 uA). RAIL_EN low (default, R21) = both rails off.\n+5V_SW only exists while USB or 12 V is present (no boost from the cell)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 660.4 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cae51e2a-af53-5fd8-81b3-696a9a342c87")
	)
	(text "VALVE DRIVERS (LOW-SIDE MOSFET PER VALVE)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 41.5371 350.395 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cbbbf85d-36b7-5b39-95d9-a35988bfa21a")
	)
	(text "12 V INPUT, PROTECTION & 5 V BUCK"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 36.2417 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f4486648-2dbc-5d84-a939-48aef25e7e1e")
	)
	(text "SENSOR PORTS: I2C, OLED, GPIO"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 259.7353 182.755 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "febdf469-4ce1-5a64-b13e-3b72e7962da1")
	)
